# Not installed in the image: carried in the ISO's package pool. The installer
# (calamares-settings-debian's bootloader-config) installs GRUB into the new
# system from there, so installs work offline.
#
# UEFI only here. grub-pc (BIOS) conflicts with grub-efi-amd64, so live-build
# can't resolve both in one list; build.sh downloads the grub-pc .debs and the
# 0910-grub-pc-pool binary hook adds them to the pool.
grub-efi-amd64
grub-efi-amd64-signed
shim-signed
cryptsetup-initramfs
keyutils
